  "$comment": "Localtime asset selection. Kenney CC0 packs only. Categories/tiers per Main steering 2026-11-09: district = low-detail buildings, skyscrapers, trees; street = apartments, villas, cars, lamps, signals, props. All Kenney city-kit buildings and vehicles are authored facing +Z (verified: sedan spoiler and delivery cargo door at -Z, house/shop entrances on the +Z facade), so rotateY is 0 everywhere. Scales in metres per kit unit: city kits 8, roads 7, nature 5, cars 1.43 (geometric mean of width target 1.9/1.5 and length target 4.1/2.55; non-uniform scaling would distort the wheels). planter override 4.",
  "$commentLod": "Fleet LOD: a model entry with a numeric decimate target produces a second, quadric-error-decimated variant under its own name (sedan-low etc). The source file is re-read and collapsed to about that many triangles before packing; the full-detail entry stays untouched for hero and parked use. Low variants keep the source category so byCategory('van') still finds the low vans; only the name marks the LOD.",
